    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53844" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατᾰγωγ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>winding-mechanism</i> of a torsion-engine, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				75.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>curved end</i> of a stomach-bow (used for stringing it), <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				78.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>woman's dress</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				14.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
